# Aquatic Alchemist counts sorceries as well as instants: Bot1 casts the Alchemist (Mox Sapphire + Mox Jet), then Preordain
# ({U}, a sorcery; the second Mox Sapphire) - the first instant or sorcery this turn, so the Alchemist becomes 3/3 - and then
# Shock at Bot2, the second, which leaves it at 3/3 (not 5/3).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Aquatic Alchemist
Preordain
Shock
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
